      "caption": "Creamy Garlic Chicken Recipe 🍗🧄 | Easy Skillet Chicken Dinner Ingredients: • 2 large chicken breasts, sliced into cutlets  • 1 tbsp olive oil  • 2 tbsp butter  • 4–5 cloves garlic, minced  • 1 cup heavy cream  • ½ cup grated Parmesan cheese  • ½ cup chicken broth  • ½ tsp Italian seasoning  • ½ tsp paprika  • Salt and black pepper, to taste  • 2 tbsp fresh parsley, chopped  Instructions: 1. Season the chicken breasts with salt, black pepper, paprika, and Italian seasoning.  2. Heat olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat. Sear the chicken until beautifully golden and cooked through. Remove and set aside.  3. In the same skillet, add butter and minced garlic. Sauté until fragrant, scraping up the browned bits from the chicken.  4. Pour in the chicken broth and heavy cream. Stir and let the sauce simmer gently.  5. Add the grated Parmesan cheese and stir until melted and the sauce becomes creamy and smooth.  6. Return the chicken to the skillet and coat each piece generously with the garlic Parmesan sauce.  7. Simmer for a few minutes, then garnish with fresh parsley.  8. Serve hot with your favorite pasta, rice, mashed potatoes, or vegetables.  Save this easy creamy chicken recipe for your next dinner!  #easyrecipesathome #homemadefood  #healthyhaven #cookingtips #foy ",
